1200 REM ---- integers, bitwise, relations ----
1210 PRINT "INTEGER"
1220 LN%=1220 \ C%=(7%\2%=3%) \ GOSUB 9000
1230 LN%=1230 \ C%=(7% MOD 2%=1%) \ GOSUB 9000
1240 LN%=1240 \ C%=((6% AND 3%)=2%) \ GOSUB 9000
1250 LN%=1250 \ C%=((4% OR 1%)=5%) \ GOSUB 9000
1260 LN%=1260 \ C%=((NOT 0%)=-1%) AND ((NOT -1%)=0%) \ GOSUB 9000
