2130 FOR I%=1% TO 3% \ FOR J%=1% TO 2% \ S%=S%+1% \ NEXT J% \ NEXT I%
2140 LN%=2140 \ C%=(S%=6%) \ GOSUB 9000
2150 I%=0%
2160 WHILE I%<4%
2170 I%=I%+1%
2180 NEXT
2190 LN%=2190 \ C%=(I%=4%) \ GOSUB 9000
2200 I%=0%
2210 UNTIL I%=3%
